  "$comment": "What a debuff does to the NPC carrying it, keyed by buff (`v:<BuffID>` for vanilla, the mod's buff class name otherwise). `dot` is HP per second, `defense` a flat change to the NPC's defense, `dmgTaken` a multiplier on every hit it receives. These are computed in GlobalNPC.UpdateLifeRegen at runtime, out of the interpreter's reach, so the numbers come from the mods' own wikis. A debuff with no entry counts for nothing — the pessimistic answer. Keyed by buff, never by weapon.",

